{"ref":"BDB, צָפָה³","hw":"צָפָה³","html":"I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צָפָה</span></big></big><sub>37</sub><big><big>]</big></big>  <strong>vb.</strong> look out or about, spy, keep watch <strong>(</strong>NH id., Pi. <em>hope;</em> Ethiopic ሰፈወ: iii. 2 <em>hope</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong><sub>28</sub>  Impf. 3 ms. juss. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִ֫צֶף בֵּינִי וּבֵינֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:49\" href=\"/Genesis.31.49\">Gn 31:49</a> (J) <em>may</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>keep watch between me and thee</em> (that the covenant be kept = <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ עֵד וגו׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:50\" href=\"/Genesis.31.50\">50</a>); 3 fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵינָיו בַּגּוֹיִם תִּצְפֶּי֑נָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:7\" href=\"/Psalms.66.7\">ψ 66:7</a> <em>his eyes keep watch upon the nations;</em> Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹפֶה רָשָׁע לַצַּדִּיק</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:32\" href=\"/Psalms.37.32\">ψ 37:32</a> <em>a wicked man spieth upon the righteous;</em> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.5\">Ct 7:5</a> the town <em>which looketh</em> toward <span dir=\"rtl\">(פְּנֵי)</span> Damascus; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹפִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.27\">Pr 31:27</a> <em>she keepeth watch</em> of (c. acc.); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵינֵי י׳ צֹפוֹת רָעִים וְטוֹבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.3\">Pr 15:3</a>; elsewhere as subst. <em>watchman</em>, abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹפֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:34\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.34\">2 S 13:34</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.16\">1 S 14:16</a>; +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹפָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.10\">Is 56:10</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">צפו</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹפַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 52:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.52.8\">Is 52:8</a>;—<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.16\">1 S 14:16</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:34\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.34\">2 S 13:34</a> + 8 times SK, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.2\">Ez 33:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.6\">6</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 52:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.52.8\">Is 52:8</a>, so in <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂדֵה צֹפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:14\" href=\"/Numbers.23.14\">Nu 23:14</a> (JE); fig. of prophets <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:8\" href=\"/Hosea.9.8\">Ho 9:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.17\">Je 6:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.17\">Ez 3:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.7\">33:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.10\">Is 56:10</a>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.1\">1 S 1:1</a> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, צוּפִי\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_צוּפִי\">צוּפִי</a>; Pt. pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָפוּ</span> (Codd. and Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">צָפוּי</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 15:22\" href=\"/Job.15.22\">Jb 15:22</a> <em>spied out</em> (and brought) <em>to</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֱלֵי)</span> the sword (Ew Bi Perles<sup>Anal. 29</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">צָפוּן</span> cf. Di Bu).<br>†<strong>Pi.</strong>  Pf. I pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִפִּינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.17\">La 4:17</a>; Impf. 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲצַפֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:7\" href=\"/Micah.7.7\">Mi 7:7</a> +; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַפֵּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:2\" href=\"/Nahum.2.2\">Na 2:2</a>, fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַפִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.19\">Je 48:19</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצַפֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.13\">1 S 4:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.6\">Is 21:6</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצַפֶּיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:4\" href=\"/Micah.7.4\">Mi 7:4</a>;—<em>watch</em> (<em>closely</em>), <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל־דֶּרֶךְ עִמְדִי וְצ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.19\">Je 48:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳־דֶרֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:2\" href=\"/Nahum.2.2\">Na 2:2</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> of person expected <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.17\">La 4:17</a>; fig. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲצַפֶּה בְּי׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:7\" href=\"/Micah.7.7\">Mi 7:7</a>; abs. lit. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.13\">1 S 4:13</a>; fig. <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:1\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.1\">Hb 2:1</a> <em>I will look forth</em>, to see <span dir=\"rtl\">(לִרְאוֹת)</span> what he will say; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:4\" href=\"/Psalms.5.4\">ψ 5:4</a> <em>I will look out</em> (expectantly); pt. as n. = <em>watchman</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.6\">Is 21:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:4\" href=\"/Micah.7.4\">Mi 7:4</a>.","next":"BDB, צְפוֹ","prev":"BDB, צָפָה²"}